    "current_linkage_note": "One live official page was verified for this topic on 2026-09-02. The Government of India's citizen-engagement platform at mygov.in was read successfully on that date and its front page displayed an open public consultation entry titled Public Consultation on the University Townships Initiative, carrying a stated start date of 10 July 2026 and a stated end date of 20 August 2026; that dated observation is used only as evidence that consultations on the platform are published with a defined comment window, and nothing is inferred from it about the initiative's design, about how many people responded or about whether any submission changed a decision. A further official check was attempted on the same date on the Legislative Department's page for the pre-legislative consultation policy and was refused with an access error, so no content from it was read or used and no secondary summary has been treated as an official source. The remaining dated official elements used are those already carried by the repository owners with their status checks, namely the Pre-Legislative Consultation Policy of 2014 as an executive policy providing for publication of a draft with explanatory material and ordinarily at least thirty days for comments subject to stated exceptions, the platform's function as a citizen-engagement and crowdsourcing channel rather than a co-decision right, the village assembly as the forum of all registered voters in a Panchayat area, Article 243S requiring Ward Committees in municipalities with a population of three lakh or more with State law determining composition, participatory budgeting as a pilot-scale Indian practice, and the consultation requirement in Fifth Schedule areas under the Panchayats Extension to Scheduled Areas Act, 1996, all as checked by the owners on 21 July 2026. No list of participatory-budgeting cities or wards is asserted, no platform user, campaign or submission count is asserted, no village-assembly attendance or meeting-frequency statistic is asserted, no count of functioning ward committees is asserted, no percentage of consultations that changed a draft is asserted, and no named consultation's outcome is asserted. The constitutional composition and mandate of the village assembly are cross-linked to Polity, the funds, functions and functionaries diagnostic to the local-governance owner, and the donor-distortion channels to the development-processes owner rather than restated here.",
    "pyq_status_note": "Two direct General Studies Paper-II Mains demands and one applied objective demand are routed to this topic across the audited ledgers, and both routed Mains stems used below were confirmed word for word in the locally held OCR-searchable official question papers. The audited 2018-2023 Mains ledger routes the 2019 demand on the need for cooperation among various service sectors and on partnership in the development process to this topic's Advanced companion, and the Basic owner records expressly that core routing supersedes that older Advanced pointer and holds all marks-bearing content for participation as a governance mechanism, so the demand is answered from the core file. The same ledger routes the 2022 demand on whether increasing dependence on donor agencies reduces the importance of community participation jointly to the development-processes owner and to this owner, because the stem names both the development industry and participation, so the four donor-distortion channels and the five-test grid remain with that owner and only the participation half is supplied here. The audited 2026 Prelims ledger routes an objective demand on participatory resolution of tribal land, waste-management and environmental conflict to this Basic owner; the 2026 Set-A key held locally is provisional, so no option, answer letter or distractor is recorded or inferred. One ownership conflict is recorded openly rather than resolved by assertion, because the 2025 General Studies Paper-II demand on decision-making and problem-solving responsibilities not located close to the source of information and execution is discussed at length in the text of this owner while the audited 2024-2025 Mains ledger routes it to the development-processes owner, so it is solved there and this owner supplies only the subsidiarity and participation half of that answer. No official answer key or marking scheme is held locally for any routed Mains demand, so every model solution below is an authored answer route rather than an official key.",
